G04 NOT FOR FABRICATION. halo REPLICA - a reconstruction from photographs.*
G04 1. 0.30 mm at 4 layers is BELOW PCBWay's 0.40 mm four-layer floor and*
G04    JLCPCB's 0.40 mm minimum. AS DRAWN THIS CANNOT BE ORDERED AT EITHER*
G04    HOUSE. The drawing is not moved to suit a process.*
G04 2. The board's own DRC HAS ERRORS. See drc-classification.json:*
G04    they are classified, not cleared, because moving a MEASURED position*
